==Battleground==
*6 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use rushers like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] to quickly beat the stage.

